// Selective use in the editor (§9.1): use geo.vec. {v2, dot} ; - The addition offers only named
// ones, as does parsing (norm2 not visible).
// program: 97_use_selective.vish
open_view module
pointer 1 @print:1 0 0
key 1 d
key 1 o
// expect: name="dot" kind="функция" detail="(a, b), модуль geo.vec"
key 1 Backspace
key 1 Backspace
key 1 n
key 1 o
key 1 r
key 1 m
// expect-not: name="norm2"
